    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Light-hearted Comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventures of Dr. Murph are light-hearted comedies. A mixture of irony and absurdism can be found in each mission he goes on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/c4f8172c8f8f025de329a6e9568e4d16.poster.avif?t=1746518452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/c4f8172c8f8f025de329a6e9568e4d16.webm?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/c4f8172c8f8f025de329a6e9568e4d16.mp4?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Quality Cartoon Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cartoon art style brings something fresh to fans of adult gaming, with cute characters and sexy animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Attractive Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with a plethora of women! You can establish relationships and have sex with most of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alluring Animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has animated sex scenes! Bonus features such as x-ray observation, changing of speed, and other customisation options are also included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/dd89ee06901560b620597714cb8f4e93.poster.avif?t=1746518452\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/dd89ee06901560b620597714cb8f4e93.webm?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/dd89ee06901560b620597714cb8f4e93.mp4?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiversal Missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you cross galaxies and dimensions, each mission will have its own unique character, distinct story, and (occasionally) links to other missions. The main quest throughout the game will remain the relationship between Repa and Dr. Murph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Post-game Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the main story will unlock new content including: additional events, new characters, new missions, and alternate costumes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/f2dceaab5c05186b230f0b1acd4dc82f.poster.avif?t=1746518452\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/f2dceaab5c05186b230f0b1acd4dc82f.webm?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/f2dceaab5c05186b230f0b1acd4dc82f.mp4?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Freeplay Sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game you will unlock portals, allowing you to quickly return to planets you previously visited!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With few exceptions, you are free to have a relationship with whomever you want, whenever you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/1bcdf8825641cece018bc5620690a999.poster.avif?t=1746518452\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/1bcdf8825641cece018bc5620690a999.webm?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/1bcdf8825641cece018bc5620690a999.mp4?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Erotic Minigames and Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with erotic mini-games with beautiful women! Most of the minigames are designed to further the ongoing narrative, and make sex scenes more interactive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/b984a243bad4409826aa0775b89cccfe.poster.avif?t=1746518452\" width=614 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/b984a243bad4409826aa0775b89cccfe.webm?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943200/extras/b984a243bad4409826aa0775b89cccfe.mp4?t=1746518452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>  </p>",
